@ Index:  Solves free-fall time, drives FreeFp
@ Author: fm org C47 test program
@ Tested: Drives FreeFp
@ Input:  none; loaded together with FreeFp
@ Output: Solution time
@
@ Calling wrapper for FreeFp.p47u; see it for details.
LBL ‘FreFp2’
  0                 ; target height
  STO ‘height’
  50                ; platform, 50 m
  STO ‘h0’
  15                ; initial velocity, 15 m/s upward
  STO ‘v0’
  5                 ; first guess for time
  STO ‘time’
  10                ; second guess, left in X
  PGMSLV ‘FreeFp’
  SOLVE ‘time’
  VIEW ‘time’
  RTN
  END
.END.
